{"suttaId":"thag5.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1506,1521],"vripara":"315"},"segments":{"thag5.1:0.4":"Rājadattattheragāthā","thag5.1:1.1":"“Bhikkhu sivathikaṃ [sīvathikaṃ (sī. syā. pī.)] gantvā, addasa itthimujjhitaṃ;","thag5.1:1.3":"Apaviddhaṃ susānasmiṃ, khajjantiṃ kimihī phuṭaṃ.","thag5.1:2.1":"“Yañhi eke jigucchanti, mataṃ disvāna pāpakaṃ;","thag5.1:2.3":"Kāmarāgo pāturahu, andhova savatī [vasatī (sī.)] ahuṃ.","thag5.1:3.1":"“Oraṃ odanapākamhā, tamhā ṭhānā apakkamiṃ;","thag5.1:3.3":"Satimā sampajānohaṃ, ekamantaṃ upāvisiṃ.","thag5.1:4.1":"“Tato me manasīkāro, yoniso udapajjatha;","thag5.1:4.3":"Ādīnavo pāturahu, nibbidā samatiṭṭhatha.","thag5.1:5.1":"“Tato cittaṃ vimucci me, passa dhammasudhammataṃ;","thag5.1:5.3":"Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsanan”ti.","thag5.1:5.5":"… Rājadatto thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
